Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.70,0:54:15.83,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Wait, wait, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.83,0:54:19.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你是说你在工作时产生了幻觉?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.83,0:54:19.01,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Are you saying you were hallucinating on the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.70,0:54:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 我是说 我总是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.70,0:54:22.47,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No. I mean, I could always
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.48,0:54:24.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}区别是否是真实的 你明白
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.48,0:54:24.51,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}tell what was real or what wasn't, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.79,0:54:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}所以当我看见一些东西 我...就会顺其自然
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.79,0:54:28.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}So when I'd see things, like, man, I'd just... ... roll with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.05,0:54:30.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}你现在还看见?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.05,0:54:30.34,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}You still see things?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.24,0:54:32.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不会了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.24,0:54:32.97,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.92,0:54:37.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}不 在我戒毒的几年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.92,0:54:37.79,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No, they stopped altogether
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.75,0:54:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}就彻底消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.75,0:54:41.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}after I was clean a couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.69,0:54:43.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}这个地方没有门牌号
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.69,0:54:43.54,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}No numbers on this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.52,0:54:47.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}火灾肯定发生在很久之前
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.52,0:54:47.99,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Fire must have happened a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.25,0:55:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}好吧 这个地方毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.25,0:55:24.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Okay. Place is trashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.29,0:55:26.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}什么东西都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.29,0:55:26.99,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}This ain't no kinda anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.48,0:55:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}在那个时候 那些异象
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.48,0:55:34.77,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, back then, the visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.53,0:55:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}大多数时候 我都确信不会再有了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.53,0:55:40.46,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Yeah, most of the time, I was convinced that I'd lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.30,0:55:43.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.30,0:55:43.11,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.59,0:56:00.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}但还有些时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.59,0:56:00.53,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}But there were other times...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.58,0:56:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,280)}我觉得自己仍沉溺于探索宇宙的神秘真相之中
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.58,0:56:11.86,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(192,264)}I thought I was mainlining the secret truth of the universe.
